include: Add the interfaces shared with the app and FEX.

ios_shared_data.h: where KUSER_SHARED_DATA lives on iOS
(WINE_USER_SHARED_DATA_ADDR); 0x7ffe0000 is inside the app's
__PAGEZERO. ios_gamepad.h: the pointer-free GameController snapshot the
app publishes and XInput reads. winternl.h: MemoryWineIosJitWriteDelta,
the information class FEX queries for the JIT arena's write alias.
---
